uild the tallest tower by stacking randomly selected 3D objects.\n\nInspired by a low poly universe with circus, theater and carnival influences, the game combines strategic construction and dynamic confrontation: players can either place their objects to stabilize their tower, or throw them at their opponent's to destabilize it.\n\nBased on a realistic physics system, the game does not artificially detect collapses, letting gravity and tower stability determine the outcome of each game. With no time limit, it offers a competitive and immersive experience, promoting strategy and skill in a unique visual and audio environment.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 40, "name": "Party"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/dramatour", "videos": [{"id": 185316, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "WcCEd-yId_s", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WcCEd-yId_s", "title": "Dramatour - Official Launch trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/WcCEd-yId_s/sddefault.jpg"}]}